      "source": "https://www.toledohistoricalsociety.org/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Early river settlements like Warbassport and Cowlitz Landing along the Cowlitz River set the stage for Toledo’s development as a port town.",
